  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka lokala samh&#xe4;llen genom att inr&#xe4;tta sm&#xe5;skaliga by-f&#xf6;retag som kommer att producera m&#xf6;bler och h&#xf6;nsfoder   fr&#xe5;n palmer och dess avfall. EGYCOM syftar till att kapitalisera p&#xe5; framg&#xe5;ngen av pilotprojektet som &#xe4;gde rum i Al Quayat by i Al-Minya. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Egyptian Society for Endogenous Development of Local Communities, org.nr 5450, Cairo, 2003. Egypt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project  is to empower local communities by setting up small-scale village enterprises that will produce          furniture items, carina and poultry feed from palm midribs and palm   tree residues. It aims to capitalise on the success of the pilot      project that took place in the Al Quayat village in Minya governorate. Agreement partner is Egyptian Society for Endogenous Development of Local Communities, org reg no 5450, Cairo, 2003. Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
